Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 14:46:17 -0700
Subject: test: regenerate the testnet header fixture for the V2 testnet

p2p_dos_header_tree's fixture held historical testnet3 headers, which
do not connect to the V2 testnet genesis or hash under the V2 header
format. Regenerate it on the V2 testnet genesis (v2/062)
and chain id (v2/061), at the powLimit 0x1e7fffff with 120 s spacing.

- Heights 1-4 chain from genesis; height 4 is 119 s ahead of the ASERT
  schedule, so height 5's minimum-difficulty bits are bad-diffbits.
- The two fork headers (merkle root 1) are accepted on node 1.

The block id commits to the chain id. The framework hashes with the
regtest id (all zeros), so messages.py gains V2_TESTNET_CHAIN_ID and
CBlockHeader.hash_hex_for_chain(), and the test uses them for its
getchaintips expectations.

Tier: V2 (fixup to v2/062)
